{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>藝人陸浩明近日現身香港理工大學出席親生胞弟陸浩輝畢業典禮，見證對方成功獲取一級榮譽學位。兩兄弟由細到大生活點滴隨着帖文公開，揭開了胞弟多年來半工讀辛酸史。然而一張罕有曝光童年合照瞬間成為全網焦點，意外引發極大爭議。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明親赴理大祝賀胞弟獲取一級榮譽學位</h2>\n<p>陸浩明親自前往香港理工大學參與胞弟陸浩輝畢業典禮，並在社交平台上載多張現場溫馨合照。相片中清晰可見現場懸掛着恭賀橫額，上面列明陸浩輝以一級榮譽優異成績畢業。陸浩明在帖文中激動留言：「恭喜細佬，讀咗幾年終於畢業啦！ 一邊返工一邊返學，成功畢業，展開你人生嘅新一頁，努力加油！」字裏行間流露對胞弟達成學業目標深深驕傲與無限支持。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明主動曬童年照揭兩兄弟昔日模樣</h2>\n<p>為了進一步與大眾分享這份難以掩飾喜悅，陸浩明隨後更大方上載兩兄弟小時候合照作對比。他親自向外界發出提問：「我哋細路仔同依家個樣認得出嗎？」這番舉動直接將焦點從學術成就轉移到兩人外貌演變之上。相片清楚展示了這對親兄弟無論是兒時階段還是成年後外貌特徵，均展現出截然不同發展軌跡。</p>\n<h2>網民笑指陸浩明細佬似阿哥多啲</h2>\n<p>照片一出即時掀起網上熱烈討論，大批網民紛紛就兩人外貌差距發表意見。有人直指：「細佬似呀哥多啲」，同時亦有不少網民針對顏值高低各自表態，分別留言力撐：「你靚仔過你細佬」以及「細佬好似靚仔過你」。向來以瘦底見稱陸浩明竟被眼利網民透過童年照看穿隱藏過去，直接留言驚呼：「你細個原來係肥仔」！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314049456577_11953150606ae3f084e1e35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314049456577_11953150606ae3f084e1e35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314355396703_14465571506ae3f0883f6f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314355396703_14465571506ae3f0883f6f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314747964775_17125551086ae3f08bbf282.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-30 at 10.11.16.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332314747964775_17125551086ae3f08bbf282.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332315757919025_8607231426ae3f09648db8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-30 at 10.11.25.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179332315757919025_8607231426ae3f09648db8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1_3229339866a994c9716d47-1024x768.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"肥媽 （圖片來源：新城）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1_3229339866a994c9716d47-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新城）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455710330847683_708533_19084608336a912fa3b25f5-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455710330847683_708533_19084608336a912fa3b25f5-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455770972247298_708533_2200757376a912f94bf618-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陸浩明 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455770972247298_708533_2200757376a912f94bf618-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:41:20.562254+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":930,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:19:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:58:28.029673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:29.071939+00:00","content_hash":"92fd735a92e55b10a9468dfa74b36f1e5dec61d3e10dea551fd0a1391602d1e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}